    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The deadline is firm due to the regulatory window, so an extension isn't an option. Regarding the incompatibility, the migration team is confident they can map your trend data into the rule-based parameters. There shouldn't be any issues with the integrity of the handover if you just package the current telemetry sets as requested. Why exactly do you think the legacy engine won't be able to handle this data?",
